        "title": "Finishing: Oils, Shellac, Lacquer, Varnish, Water-Based",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PENETRATING FINISHES (absorbed into wood; no film on surface)\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| Boiled linseed oil (BLO)  | Oxidative curing; slow; amber|\n| Tung oil                  | Oxidative curing; more water |\n|                           | resistant than BLO           |\n| Danish oil                | BLO or tung + varnish (combo)|\n| Waterlox                  | Tung oil + phenolic varnish  |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n→ Feel: \"in\" the wood, not \"on\" the wood\n→ Protection: low-moderate\n→ Repair: easy (reapply)"
    },
