        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Finishing: Oils, Shellac, Lacquer, Varnish, Water-Based",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DANISH OIL / WATERLOX:\n  Really: blended products (oil + varnish + mineral spirits)\n  Penetrating AND film-building simultaneously (small film)\n  More protection than straight oil\n  Brands: Waterlox Original, Tried and True, Rubio Monocoat"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FINISHING.md#016",
      "path": [
        "06-FINISHING.md"
