        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Finishing: Oils, Shellac, Lacquer, Varnish, Water-Based",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WIPING VARNISH (often mislabeled \"tung oil\" or \"danish oil\"):\n  Varnish diluted with mineral spirits\n  Apply thin coats; penetrates + builds thin film\n  More protection than pure oil; less than full varnish\n  Can be built with many coats\n  \"Wipe-on poly\" (Minwax) = polyurethane varnish diluted for wiping\n```"
    },
